 ☕ Hello, Tuesday! Two weeks till Election Day. Smart Brevity™ count: 1,794 words ... 7 mins. Thanks to Noah Bressner for orchestrating. Edited by Bill Kole. 

 🗳️ Breaking with the boss: Vice President Vance declined to endorse Benjamin Netanyahu for reelection. President Trump backed the embattled Israeli leader on Sunday. Vance told Mark Halperin: "The president has the most influential endorsement ... So I'm not getting involved in Israeli elections." Get the latest . 

 
 
